<p>When you are hit by a projectile, physical or otherwise, you have a <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3%, 14%, 21%, 27%, 31%</acronym> chance to deflect it up to <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 3, 3, 3</acronym> squares away. At talent level 5, your Bash and Smash shield hit is a guaranteed critical.</p>